<p class="leading-6 text-muted"><strong class="font-semibold text-ink" data-dialog-field="question"></strong> will be permanently removed.</p>
<form asp-action="Delete" method="post" class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3">
    <input type="hidden" name="id" data-dialog-field="id" />
